      "type": "引用",
      "type_label": "引用",
      "text": "Hello from orbit!\n\nOne of the first images from Maxwell, the spacecraft we built for @Viasat, featuring our solar array.\n \nMaxwell is healthy and moving through commissioning ahead of schedule.",
      "quote": {
        "author": "viasat",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1966159505047388160/dXa9Q545_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-04 04:16:02",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-11-03T20:16:02.000Z",
        "id": "2117712427420697045",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWOgOv3WcAA5JSY.jpg?name=small"
        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "height": 667,
            "type": "photo",
            "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWOgOv3WcAA5JSY.jpg?name=small",
            "width": 800
          }
        ],
        "name": "Viasat",
        "text": "Promising progress for Maxwell and our @NASA Communications Services Project. The team is moving towards the first L‑band network relay demo and prepping for the Ka‑band antenna deployment. Excited to continue this mission with @RocketLab and the NASA CSP team. \n\n📸: Rocket Lab",
        "url": "https://x.com/viasat/status/2117712427420697045",
        "verified": false,
        "verified_type": ""
      },
      "retweet": null,
