      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "Mission success! Repeat customer @QPS_Inc has made contact with its latest QPS-SAR satellite following their tenth ride on Electron.\n\nWe are proud to be the primary launcher for the Japan-based Earth imaging company's commercial synthetic aperture radar (SAR) constellation.\n\nUp next: Our 100th Electron launch.",
