      "type": "引用",
      "type_label": "引用",
      "text": "We've officially launched Electron 99 times.\n\nIt took us seven years to reach 50. Now, just two years later, we're closing in on 100.\n\nHighlights from today's mission for @QPS_Inc :\n✅Launched on 1st attempt\n✅20th mission of the year\n✅99th Electron mission overall\n✅10th launch for iQPS with 100% mission success",
