    {
      "id": "2117252668246921434",
      "author": "rocketlab",
      "author_name": "Rocket Lab",
      "author_avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1494443717452709900/Y7Lg2mm__200x200.jpg",
      "author_verified": true,
      "author_verified_type": "organization",
      "created_at_utc": "2026-11-02T13:49:07.000Z",
      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-02 21:49:07",
      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "This launch will be our 10th dedicated mission for @QPS_Inc\n\nWe are the primary launcher for the Japan-based Earth imaging company's commercial synthetic aperture radar (SAR) constellation.\n\nHere are the missions we've launched for iQPS so far:\n🚀 \"The Moon God Awakens\" (📸 pictured)\n🚀 \"The Lightning God Reigns\"\n🚀 \"The Sea God Sees\"\n🚀 \"The Mountain God Guards\"\n🚀 \"The Harvest Goddess Thrives\"\n🚀 \"The Nation God Navigates\"\n🚀 \"The Wisdom God Guides\"\n🚀 \"The Grain Goddess Provides\"\n🚀 \"The Lightning God Defends\"\n\nLaunching today: \"The Sea God Surveys\".\n\nWindow opens 05:30am NZDT local time. 16:30 UTC.",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": null,
      "reply_to": "",
      "engagement": {
        "bookmarks": 4,
        "likes": 628,
        "quotes": 5,
        "replies": 7,
        "retweets": 44,
        "views": 24367
      },
      "url": "https://x.com/rocketlab/status/2117252668246921434",
      "images": [
        "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWH4LQOaYAA13k6.jpg?name=small"
      ],
      "media": [
